title: The fault in the subscribee folder's drawing looks like another cause.
pid: a4b9fd62-e642-4e2f-a201-31200164e622
body: |2-
  A fresh view of a fork drew its subscribee with a count, 'C2/', and
  no children, both in your mailbox fork and in a test fixture where
  the subscriber had forked nothing. So it is not about forking. I did
  not look further; I noted it under "It is drawn only where the
  subscribee is drawn."
